      "ayah_arabic": "وَجَعَلۡنَا فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ رَوَٰسِيَ أَن تَمِيدَ بِهِمۡ وَجَعَلۡنَا فِيهَا فِجَاجࣰ ا سُبُلࣰ ا لَّعَلَّهُمۡ يَهۡتَدُونَ",
      "surah_revelation": "Meccan",
      "surah_name": "Al-Anbiyaa",
      "literal_gloss": "broad passes",
      "translations": {
        "saheeh": "And We placed within the earth firmly set mountains, lest it should shift with them, and We made therein [mountain] passes [as] roads that they might be guided.",
        "pickthall": "And We have placed in the earth firm hills lest it quake with them, and We have placed therein ravines as roads that haply they may find their way.",
        "khattab": "And We have placed firm mountains upon the earth so it does not shake with them, and made in it broad pathways so they may find their way",
        "arberry": "And We set in the earth firm mountains lest it should shake with them, and We set in it ravines to serve as ways, that haply so they may be guided;"
      }
    },
